      "key": "quickFacts",
      "source": "tropica",
      "sourceUrl": "https://tropica.com/en/plants/plantdetails/Cryptocorynewendtii'Green'(109TC)/19226",
      "html": "<ul><li>Origin: Asia</li><li>Growth rate: Medium</li><li>Height: 10-30+ cm (after two months in the tank)</li><li>Light demand: Low</li><li>CO2: Low</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "key": "maintenance",
      "source": "tropica",
      "sourceUrl": "https://tropica.com/en/plants/plantdetails/Cryptocorynewendtii'Green'(109TC)/19226",
      "html": "<p>Aquarium plant from tissue culture in closed cup. Depending on your aquarium setup wendtii 'Green' can reach a height of 10-30 cm with rosettes ranging from 8-15 cm wide. When grown in an open space the leaves will virtually lie on the bottom. Like most other Sri Lanka Cryptocorynes, it also grows well in hard water. Easy to grow, it thrives in almost all conditions, even in the shadow of larger plants.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "notes",
      "source": "tropica",
      "sourceUrl": "https://tropica.com/en/plants/plantdetails/Cryptocorynewendtii'Green'(109TC)/19226",
      "html": "<p>Cryptocoryne wendtii 'Green' presents beautiful, green leaves. A fresh green group of Cryptocoryne wendtii 'Green' will decorate any tank.</p>"
    }
  ],
